 overflow-hidden grain\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none\"><div class=\"aurora-1 absolute -top-40 -left-40 w-[700px] h-[700px] rounded-full bg-blue-300/20 blur-3xl\"></div><div class=\"aurora-2 absolute top-1/4 -right-32 w-[600px] h-[600px] rounded-full bg-indigo-400/15 blur-3xl\"></div><div class=\"aurora-3 absolute -bottom-20 left-1/3 w-[500px] h-[500px] rounded-full bg-violet-300/12 blur-3xl\"></div><div class=\"aurora-4 absolute top-1/2 left-1/4 w-[400px] h-[400px] rounded-full bg-sky-300/10 blur-3xl\"></div></div><div class=\"flex min-h-screen\"><div class=\"flex flex-col justify-center px-8 md:px-14 lg:px-20 relative z-10 w-full md:w-1/2 py-28\"><div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-gray-200 bg-gray-50 text-gray-500 text-xs font-semibold mb-4 w-fit\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin w-3 h-3\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg> Albany Metro, NY · For the community, by the community</div><div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-gray-900 text-white text-xs font-semibold mb-6 w-fit\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(10px)\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-green-400 animate-pulse\"></span>Only 3 new client spots open this month</div><h1 class=\"text-5xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-black leading-[1.05] text-gray-900 mb-6\" style=\"opacity:0;filter:blur(10px);transform:translateY(60px)\">Someone in Albany<br/>just searched<br/>for you.<br/><span class=\"text-gray-400\">Did they find you?</span></h1><p class=\"text-gray-500 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-4 max-w-md\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><strong class=\"text-gray-800\">81% of customers</strong> research online before visiting a local business. If your website is outdated, missing, or hard to find — they&#x27;re already at your competitor&#x27;s door.</p><div class=\"flex items-start gap-2 mb-8 p-3 rounded-xl bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100 max-w-md\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(10px)\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-alert w-4 h-4 text-gray-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><line x1=\"12\" x2=\"12\" y1=\"8\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"12\" x2=\"12.01\" y1=\"16\" y2=\"16\"></line></svg><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-500\">Every day without a proper website is a day you&#x27;re handing customers to the business next door.</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3 mb-10\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><a href=\"/contact\" class=\"shimmer inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-6 py-3.5 bg-gray-900 text-white font-bold rounded-xl text-sm hover:bg-gray-700 transition-all hover:scale-105 shadow-lg shadow-black/10\">Get a Free Mockup <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right w-4 h-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a><a href=\"/our-work\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-6 py-3.5 bg-white border-2 border-gray-200 text-gray-700 font-semibold rounded-xl text-sm hover:border-gray-400 transition-all\">See Local Sites We Built</a></div><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-400 mb-10\" style=\"opacity:0\">Free mockup · No credit card · No obligation · We&#x27;ll show you exactly what your site could look like.</p><div class=\"flex gap-8 mb-10 pb-10 border-b border-gray-100\" style=\"opacity:0\"><div><div class=\"text-2xl font-black text-gray-900\">5</div><div class=\"text-xs text-gray-600 font-semibold mt-0.5\">Founding Spots</div><div class=\"text-xs text-gray-400\">3 still open</div></div><div><div class=\"text-2xl font-black text-gray-900\">$10</div><div class=\"text-xs text-gray-600 font-semibold mt-0.5\">Starting / mo</div><div class=\"text-xs text-gray-400\">less than Netflix</div></div><div><div class=\"text-2xl font-black text-gray-900\">48h</div><div class=\"text-xs text-gray-600 font-semibold mt-0.5\">Avg Launch</div><div class=\"text-xs text-gray-400\">not months</div></div></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-4 max-w-md\" style=\"opacity:0\"><div class=\"flex -space-x-2 shrink-0\"><img src=\"https://randomuser.me/api/portraits/women/44.jpg\" alt=\"client\" class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full border-2 border-white object-cover\"/><img src=\"https://randomuser.me/api/portraits/men/32.jpg\" alt=\"client\" class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full border-2 border-white object-cover\"/><img src=\"https://randomuser.me/api/portraits/men/67.jpg\" alt=\"client\" class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full border-2 border-white object-cover\"/><img src=\"https://randomuser.me/api/portraits/women/29.jpg\" alt=\"client\" class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full border-2 border-white object-cover\"/></div><div><div class=\"flex gap-0.5 mb-1\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-star w-3 h-3 fill-amber-400 text-amber-400\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M11.525 2.295a.53.53 0 0 1 .95 0l2.31 4.679a2.123 2.123 0 0 0 1.595 1.16l5.166.756a.53.53 0 0 1 .294.904l-3.736 3.638a2.123 2.123 0 0 0-.611 1.878l.882 5.14a.53.53 0 0 1-.771.56l-4.618-2