</section><section class=\"py-24 lg:py-32 bg-white bg-dot-grid relative overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"text-center mb-14\" style=\"opacity:0;filter:blur(8px);transform:translateY(40px)\"><span class=\"inline-block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-blue-600 mb-3\">Pricing</span><h2 class=\"text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-black text-gray-900 mb-4 leading-tight\">No agency sticker shock.<br/><span class=\"bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 to-indigo-600 bg-clip-text text-transparent\">Just honest numbers.</span></h2><p class=\"text-gray-500 text-lg max-w-xl mx-auto\">A freelancer charges $1,500+ for design alone. Your entire first year with us costs less than $300.</p></div><div class=\"grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-10 items-center\"><div class=\"space-y-4\" style=\"opacity:0;filter:blur(6px);transform:translateX(-50px)\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-5 p-5 rounded-2xl border-2 border-gray-100 bg-white hover:border-blue-100 hover:shadow-md transition-all\"><span class=\"text-4xl font-black text-gray-900 w-20 shrink-0\">$100</span><div><p class=\"font-black text-gray-900 text-sm\">Month 1</p><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-500\">Full site designed &amp; launched</p></div></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-5 p-5 rounded-2xl border-2 border-gray-100 bg-white hover:border-blue-100 hover:shadow-md transition-all\"><span class=\"text-4xl font-black text-gray-900 w-20 shrink-0\">$40</span><div><p class=\"font-black text-gray-900 text-sm\">Months 2–3</p><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-500\">Per month — tuning &amp; monitoring</p></div></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-5 p-5 rounded-2xl border-2 border-gray-100 bg-white hover:border-blue-100 hover:shadow-md transition-all\"><span class=\"text-4xl font-black text-gray-900 w-20 shrink-0\">$10</span><div><p class=\"font-black text-gray-900 text-sm\">Month 4 onward</p><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-500\">Per month, forever. No contracts.</p></div></div><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-gray-900 rounded-2xl text-white\"><span class=\"text-sm text-gray-400\">Full year 1 total</span><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><span class=\"text-sm text-gray-500 line-through\">$5,000+ agency</span><span class=\"text-2xl font-black\">~$270</span></div></div></div><div class=\"space-y-5\" style=\"opacity:0;filter:blur(6px);transform:translateX(50px)\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-black text-gray-900\">Everything included:</h3><ul class=\"space-y-3\"><li class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-sm text-gray-700\"><div class=\"w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-emerald-100 border border-emerald-200 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check w-3 h-3 text-emerald-600\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg></div>Custom design — no templates</li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-sm text-gray-700\"><div class=\"w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-emerald-100 border border-emerald-200 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check w-3 h-3 text-emerald-600\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg></div>Mobile-first, fast load times</li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-sm text-gray-700\"><div class=\"w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-emerald-100 border border-emerald-200 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check w-3 h-3 text-emerald-600\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg></div>Online booking widget</li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-sm text-gray-700\"><div class=\"w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-emerald-100 border border-emerald-200 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check w-3 h-3 text-emerald-600\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg></div>SSL + hosting included</li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-sm text-gray-700\"><div class=\"w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-emerald-100 border border-emerald-200 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check w-3 h-3 text-emerald-600\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg></div>Local SEO setup</li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-sm text-gray-700\"><div class=\"w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-emerald-100 border border-emerald-200 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check w-3 h-3 text-emerald-600\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg></div>30-day money-back guarantee</li></ul><div class=\"pt-2 space-y-3\"><a href=\"/pricing\" class=\"shimmer inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3.5 bg-gray-900 text-white font-bold rounded-full text-sm hover:bg-gray-700 transition-all hover:scale-105\">See full pricing breakdown <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right w-4 h-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-400\">🔒 30-day guarantee · No contracts · Cancel anytime</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-24 lg:py-32 mesh-dark bg-dot-grid-dark overflow-hidden relative\"><div class=\"max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"text-center mb-4\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)\"><span class=\"inline-block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-blue-400 mb-3\">Founding Client Program</span><h2 class=\"text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-black text-white mb-4 leading-tight\">We&#x27;re just getting started.<br/><span class=\"bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-400 to-indigo-400 bg-clip-text text-transparent\">Be one of the first 5.</span></h2><p class=\"text-lg text-gray-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto\">We won&#x27;t pretend we have 50 happy clients yet. We don&#x27;t. What we have is sharp skills, a genuine love for Albany businesses, and 5 spots for people who want to get in early — and get a lot more for it.</p></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-4 p-5 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 mb-12 max-w-2xl mx-auto\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-megaphone w-5 h-5 text-blue-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M11 6a13 13 0 0 0 8.4-2.8A1 1 0 0 1 21 4v12a1 1 0 0 1-1.6.8A13 13 0 0 0 11 14H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2z\"></path><path d=\"M6 14a12 12 0 0 0 2.4 7.2 2 2 0 0 0 3.2-2.4A8 8 0 0 1 10 14\"></path><path d=\"M8 6v8\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-300 leading-relaxed\"><strong class=\"text-white\">Straight talk:</strong> We&#x27;re a startup. We built 6 demo sites to prove what we can do. Now we want real Albany businesses to work with — and we&#x27;re willing to earn your trust by overdelivering on the first few. That&#x27;s the deal.</p></div><div class=\"flex justify-center gap-3 mb-12\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-1.5 px-4 py-3 rounded-xl border text-xs font-semibold transition-all border-gray-700 bg-gray-800 text-gray-500\"><span class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-gray-600\"></span>Spot 1 — Taken</div><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-1.5 px-4 py-3 rounded-xl border text-xs font-semibold transition-all border-gray-700 bg-gray-800 text-gray-500\"><span class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-gray-600\"></span>Spot 2 — Taken</div><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-1.5 px-4 py-3 rounded-xl border text-xs font-semibold transition-all border-blue-500/40 bg-blue-500/10 text-blue-300\"><span class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-green-400 animate-pulse\"></span>Spot 3 — Open</div><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-1.5 px-4 py-3 rounded-xl border text-xs font-semibold transition-all border-blue-500/40 bg-blue-500/10 text-blue-300\"><span class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-green-400 animate-pulse\"></span>Spot 4 — Open</div><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-1.5 px-4 py-3 rounded-xl border text-xs font-semibold transition-all border-blue-500/40 bg-blue-500/10 text-blue-300\"><span class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-green-400 animate-pulse\"></span>Spot 5 — Open</div></div><div class=\"grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-5 mb-12\"><div class=\"flex gap-4 p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10 hover:bg-white/8 transition-colors\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><span class=\"text-2xl shrink-0\">💰</span><div><h4 class=\"font-bold text-white text-sm mb-1\">Founding price. Locked forever.</h4><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed\">Whatever you pay as a founding client is what you pay forever. When we raise prices as we grow, you won&#x27;t see it.</p></div></div><div class=\"flex gap-4 p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10 hover:bg-white/8 transition-colors\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><span class=\"text-2xl shrink-0\">🎨</span><div><h4 class=\"font-bold text-white text-sm mb-1\">More attention than you&#x27;ll ever get again.</h4><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed\">Right now you get Likki — the founder — personally working on your site. Not a junior, not a template. Her full focus.</p></div></div><div class=\"flex gap-4 p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10 hover:bg-white/8 transition-colors\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><span class=\"text-2xl shrink-0\">🔧</span><div><h4 class=\"font-bold text-white text-sm mb-1\">You shape the product.</h4><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed\">Founding clients get to tell us what&#x27;s missing, what&#x27;s confusing, and what they wish existed. We actually build it.</p></div></div><div class=\"flex gap-4 p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10 hover:bg-white/8 transition-colors\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><span class=\"text-2xl shrink-0\">📣</span><div><h4 class=\"font-bold text-white text-sm mb-1\">You become our story.</h4><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed\">We&#x27;ll feature your business prominently. Your real results become the proof that helps the next Albany business say yes.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-white/10 p-6 mb-10 text-center\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><p class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-gray-500 mb-4\">What we&#x27;re aiming for you to say — genuinely, not fabricated</p><div class=\"flex justify-center gap-0.5 mb-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-star w-4 h-4 fill-amber-400 text-amber-400\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M11.525 2.295a.53.53 0 0 1 .95 0l2.31 4.679a2.123 2.123 0 0 0 1.595 1.16l5.166.756a.53.53 0 0 1 .294.904l-3.736 3.638a2.123 2.123 0 0 0-.611 1.878l.882 5.14a.53.53 0 0 1-.771.56l-4.618-2.428a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-1.973 0L6.396 21.01a.53.53 0 0 1-.77-.56l.881-5.139a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-.611-1.879L2.16 9.795a.53.53 0 0 1 .294-.906l5.165-.755a2.122 2.122 0 0 0 1.597-1.16z\"></path></svg><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-star w-4 h-4 fill-amber-400 text-amber-400\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M11.525 2.295a.53.53 0 0 1 .95 0l2.31 4.679a2.123 2.123 0 0 0 1.595 1.16l5.166.756a.53.53 0 0 1 .294.904l-3.736 3.638a2.123 2.123 0 0 0-.611 1.878l.882 5.14a.53.53 0 0 1-.771.56l-4.618-2.428a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-1.973 0L6.396 21.01a.53.53 0 0 1-.77-.56l.881-5.139a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-.611-1.879L2.16 9.795a.53.53 0 0 1 .294-.906l5.165-.755a2.122 2.122 0 0 0 1.597-1.16z\"></path></svg><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-star w-4 h-4 fill-amber-400 text-amber-400\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M11.525 2.295a.53.53 0 0 1 .95 0l2.31 4.679a2.123 2.123 0 0 0 1.595 1.16l5.166.756a.53.53 0 0 1 .294.904l-3.736 3.638a2.123 2.123 0 0 0-.611 1.878l.882 5.14a.53.53 0 0 1-.771.56l-4.618-2.428a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-1.973 0L6.396 21.01a.53.53 0 0 1-.77-.56l.881-5.139a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-.611-1.879L2.16 9.795a.53.53 0 0 1 .294-.906l5.165-.755a2.122 2.122 0 0 0 1.597-1.16z\"></path></svg><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-star w-4 h-4 fill-amber-400 text-amber-400\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M11.525 2.295a.53.53 0 0 1 .95 0l2.31 4.679a2.123 2.123 0 0 0 1.595 1.16l5.166.756a.53.53 0 0 1 .294.904l-3.736 3.638a2.123 2.123 0 0 0-.611 1.878l.882 5.14a.53.53 0 0 1-.771.56l-4.618-2.428a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-1.973 0L6.396 21.01a.53.53 0 0 1-.77-.56l.881-5.139a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-.611-1.879L2.16 9.795a.53.53 0 0 1 .294-.906l5.165-.755a2.122 2.122 0 0 0 1.597-1.16z\"></path></svg><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-star w-4 h-4 fill-amber-400 text-amber-400\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M11.525 2.295a.53.53 0 0 1 .95 0l2.31 4.679a2.123 2.123 0 0 0 1.595 1.16l5.166.756a.53.53 0 0 1 .294.904l-3.736 3.638a2.123 2.123 0 0 0-.611 1.878l.882 5.14a.53.53 0 0 1-.771.56l-4.618-2.428a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-1.973 0L6.396 21.01a.53.53 0 0 1-.77-.56l.881-5.139a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-.611-1.879L2.16 9.795a.53.53 0 0 1 .294-.906l5.165-.755a2.122 2.122 0 0 0 1.597-1.16z\"></path></svg></div><p class=\"text-lg text-white font-medium italic max-w-lg mx-auto leading-relaxed\">&quot;I was one of their first clients. Best business decision I made this year.&quot;</p><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-500 mt-2\">— That could be you. For real this time.</p></div><div class=\"text-center\" style=\"opacity:0\"><a href=\"/contact\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-8 py-4 bg-white text-gray-900 font-bold rounded-xl text-sm hover:bg-gray-100 transition-all hover:scale-105 shadow-lg\">Claim a Founding Spot <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right w-4 h-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 mt-3\">Free mockup first. No credit card. No obligation. Just an honest conversation.</p></div></div></section><footer class=\"relative overflow-hidden bg-gray-950 text-white\"><div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-96 h-96 bg-blue-600/5 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none\"></div><div class=\"absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-72 h-72 bg-indigo-600/5 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none\"></div><div class=\"border-b border-white/10\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-10\"><div class=\"flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-6\"><div class=\"text-center lg:text-left\"><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-black mb-1\">Let&#x27;s build something great together.<!-- --> <span class=\"bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-400 to-indigo-400 bg-clip-text text-transparent\">Right here in Albany.</span></h3><p class=\"text-white/50 text-sm\">No fancy agency. Just neighbors who know how to build a great website.</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-3 justify-center shrink-0\"><a href=\"/contact\" class=\"px-6 py-3 bg-white text-gray-900 font-bold rounded-xl text-sm hover:bg-gray-100 transition-colors hover:scale-105 transform\">Get a Free Quote →</a><a href=\"mailto:info@mylobstr.com\" class=\"px-6 py-3 bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 rounded-xl font-bold text-sm transition-colors flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-mail w-4 h-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m22 7-8.991 5.727a2 2 0 0 1-2.009 0L2 7\"></path><rect x=\"2\" y=\"4\" width=\"20\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\"></rect></svg>info@mylobstr.com</a></div></div></div></div><div class=\"relative max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16\"><div class=